{"id": "DbQmUp-yEko", "title": "Video by grindyrix", "description": "Jim Rohn was born on September 17, 1930, in Yakima. Raised with humble beginnings, he developed a deep appreciation for discipline, personal responsibility, and lifelong learning. His journey from financial struggle to becoming one of the world's most influential motivational speakers reflects perseverance, wisdom, and a commitment to self-improvement.\n\nRohn gained international recognition through his seminars, books, and timeless teachings on success, leadership, and personal development. His practical philosophy emphasized that lasting success is built through consistent habits, disciplined thinking, and continuous growth. His ideas have influenced generations of entrepreneurs, business leaders, and renowned speakers around the world.\n\nBeyond business and motivation, Jim Rohn is remembered for his wisdom, integrity, and ability to simplify life's most important lessons. His legacy continues to inspire people to take responsibility for their future, invest in personal growth, and pursue excellence with patience and purpose.\n.\n.\n.\nFollow @grindyrix for more \n.\n.\n.\nSpeaker: Jim Rohn \nClip Credit: To the respective owner \n.\n.\n.\n#mindset #motivation #discipline ##mindsetshift #hardwork", "channel": "grindyrix", "uploader_id": "29242552905", "uploader": "Grindyrix", "timestamp": 1785075978, "like_count": 410711, "comment_count": 1146, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/151.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1006551952263530a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 55.441, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://scontent-bog2-2.cdnins